<title>USA: Kent sees &quot;significant&quot; Q1 net loss.</title>
<headline>Kent sees &quot;significant&quot; Q1 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>BEDMINSTER, N.J. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kent Financial Services Inc said Monday it anticipates &quot;a significant net loss&quot; for the first quarter, which ends March 31.</p>
<p>The company did not elaborate on the prediction.</p>
<p>Last year the company reported first quarter earnings of $395,000 or $0.38 per share.</p>
</text>
